<p>I'm speechless. This draft is utterly ridiculous, not-at-all serious, and a complete joke. And the best comedic scip I've read yet. Seriously, how has no one commented on this? The final log is one of the best things about it. You set up a (semi)realistic scenario with the cops, and then turn everything on its head with a cosmic entity. I only have one real question. Why has the Foundation not attempted to use this to help contain/slow down dangerous scips? Although you definitely have enough material, a short addenda talking about perhaps the results of some tests on other scips could provide a comedic sharp contrast between the incident report and a bit of dry, humorless test results. But yes, I certainly found it lovely to read, and you kept me chuckleing the entire time.</p>

