			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4851430">
									

<p>1) You have something that covers roughly 270,000 square miles and you think that The Foundation has enough amnestics to deal with the situation? And that ANYONE can keep THAT a secret? Yeah, it ain't happening. You need to shrink this by a lot.</p>
<p>2) No conversion back is possible? Again, if you're trying to keep this a secret, this ain't working. Even if you shrink the size of this down to a city, that's still a lot of transformed individuals that the MTFs aren't getting to and will be around well after the fact. You're going to have a couple of organizations looking to snag a couple of the individuals as weapons for later.</p>
<p>The quicky solution is that the transformation only lasts a few hours after the rain, possibly with individuals that have been in the rain lasting a little longer. Otherwise, you're going to have a lot aggressive individuals to account for.</p>
<p>3) With this much chaos, there has to be a way to predict where it's going to be or it's going to be causing a lot of problems, even if it's only every four years.</p>

