<p>Before now I never actually read over SCP-3550, and that is indeed extremely similar. I apologise if it seems as if I'm attempting to rip it off - I can assure you I quite literally had no idea about it previously. I'll take your advice and revisit it later, however when I <strong>do</strong> revisit it then I'll do what you said. I'll put a high emphasis on the interviews from people trying to find out their past and what actually caused this to begin. Either that or I entirely scrap it, as it's extremely similar to what you wrote and I simply couldn't write something like that as well. Thank you very very much for the advice, it's truly appreciated.</p>

